      <h1 class="blog-title">The Liverpool HMO Landlord's Gas Safety Compliance Checklist</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">If you run an HMO in Liverpool, gas safety failures hit harder than in a single let. A lapsed gas certificate can put your HMO licence at risk. Here is what you need to stay legal.</p>
      <div class="blog-meta">
        <span><strong>By</strong> Liverpool Emergency Plumber</span>
        <span><strong>Gas Safe Registered Plumber</strong></span>
        <span>November 2025</span>
        <span>Updated 26 November 2026</span>
        <span>7 min read</span>
      </div>
